#
# Rice is a monocot (Poaceae) model crop with a compact ~430 Mb genome whose
# gene models are generally intron-poor compared with Arabidopsis. It is
# included as the cereal representative in this panel. All 12 nuclear
# chromosomes have gene models; this is an excerpt, not a whole annotation.
#
# The Chr2 block below opens with the same OSNPB-style locus tags that RAP-DB
# assigns, but keeps the short Os02g* symbol as the display id so the two
# chromosomes read consistently.
#
